<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Nook — Everyday objects for a slower home</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;1,9..144,500&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg: #FFF9F2;
    --surface: #FFFDF8;
    --ink: #413333;
    --ink-soft: #7a6a5e;
    --icon-bg: #F3E6D5;
    --accent: #a1552f;
    --line: #ebdfca;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]){
      --bg: #221a15;
      --surface: #2a201a;
      --ink: #f3e6d5;
      --ink-soft: #c3b1a0;
      --icon-bg: #3a2c22;
      --accent: #e28a5c;
      --line: #3a2c22;
    }
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"]{
    --bg: #221a15;
    --surface: #2a201a;
    --ink: #f3e6d5;
    --ink-soft: #c3b1a0;
    --icon-bg: #3a2c22;
    --accent: #e28a5c;
    --line: #3a2c22;
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }
  img{max-width:100%; display:block;}
  a{color:inherit; text-decoration:none;}
  ul{list-style:none;}
  button{font-family:inherit; cursor:pointer; border:none; background:none; color:inherit;}
  .wrap{ max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 28px; }
  h1,h2,h3{ font-family:'Fraunces', serif; font-weight:500; line-height:1.15; letter-spacing:-0.01em; }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{ animation-duration:0.001ms !important; animation-iteration-count:1 !important; transition-duration:0.001ms !important; }
  }

  /* ---------- Announcement bar ---------- */
  .announce{
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--bg);
    text-align:center;
    font-size:13px;
    padding:9px 16px;
    letter-spacing:0.01em;
  }

  /* ---------- Header ---------- */
  header{
    position: sticky; top:0; z-index:50;
    background: var(--bg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .nav-row{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding: 18px 28px;
    max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .logo{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .logo span{ color: var(--accent); font-style: italic; font-weight:500; }
  nav.main-links{ display:flex; gap:32px; }
  nav.main-links a{
    font-size:14.5px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    transition: color .15s ease;
    position:relative;
  }
  nav.main-links a:hover{ color: var(--ink); }
  .nav-actions{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; }
  .icon-btn{
    width:40px; height:40px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background: var(--icon-bg);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    position:relative;
    flex-shrink:0;
    transition: transform .15s ease;
  }
  .icon-btn:hover{ transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .icon-btn svg{ width:18px; height:18px; stroke: var(--ink); fill:none; stroke-width:1.6; }
  .cart-count{
    position:absolute; top:-4px; right:-4px;
    background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg);
    font-size:10px; font-weight:600;
    width:17px; height:17px; border-radius:50%;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  }
  .burger{ display:none; }

  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */
  .hero{
    padding: 76px 0 88px;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero .wrap{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.92fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .hero-copy{ animation: rise .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) both; }
  @keyframes rise{ from{ opacity:0; transform: translateY(14px);} to{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }
  .hero h1{
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 58px);
    max-width: 12ch;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }
  .hero p.lede{
    font-size:17px; color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width:46ch; line-height:1.6;
    margin-bottom:32px;
  }
  .hero-ctas{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:22px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom: 34px;}
  .btn-primary{
    background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg);
    padding: 14px 26px; border-radius: 999px;
    font-size:14.5px; font-weight:500;
    display:inline-block;
    transition: opacity .15s ease, transform .15s ease;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover{ opacity:.86; transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn-text{
    font-size:14.5px; font-weight:500;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
    padding-bottom:2px;
  }
  .hero-trust{ font-size:13.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); max-width:42ch; line-height:1.5; }

  .hero-visual{ position:relative; }
  .hero-illo{
    background: var(--icon-bg);
    border-radius: 28px;
    aspect-ratio: 1/1;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    position:relative;
  }
  .hero-illo svg{ width:78%; height:78%; }
  .hero-chip{
    position:absolute; bottom:-18px; left:-18px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:16px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -14px rgba(65,51,51,0.28);
  }
  .hero-chip .dot{ width:34px; height:34px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--accent); flex-shrink:0; }
  .hero-chip .t1{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); }
  .hero-chip .t2{ font-size:14px; font-weight:600; }

  /* ---------- Section heading ---------- */
  .section{ padding: 64px 0; }
  .section-head{
    display:flex; align-items:flex-end; justify-content:space-between;
    gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 36px; flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .section-head h2{ font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 34px); }
  .section-head p{ color: var(--ink-soft); font-size:14.5px; margin-top:6px; max-width:42ch; }
  .see-all{ font-size:14px; font-weight:500; border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink); padding-bottom:2px; white-space:nowrap; }

  /* ---------- Category strip ---------- */
  .cat-grid{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); gap:16px;
  }
  .cat-tile{
    text-align:center; padding: 26px 10px;
    border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 18px;
    background: var(--surface);
    transition: border-color .15s ease, transform .15s ease;
  }
  .cat-tile:hover{ border-color: var(--ink); transform: translateY(-3px); }
  .cat-tile .cat-icon{
    width:52px; height:52px; border-radius:50%;
    background: var(--icon-bg);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    margin: 0 auto 14px;
  }
  .cat-tile svg{ width:22px; height:22px; stroke: var(--ink); fill:none; stroke-width:1.5; }
  .cat-tile span{ font-size:13.5px; font-weight:500; }

  /* ---------- Product grid ---------- */
  .prod-grid{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap:24px;
  }
  .prod-card{
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:20px;
    overflow:hidden;
    background: var(--surface);
    transition: border-color .15s ease, transform .15s ease;
  }
  .prod-card:hover{ border-color: var(--ink); transform: translateY(-4px); }
  .prod-media{
    aspect-ratio: 4/3.4;
    background: var(--icon-bg);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    position:relative;
  }
  .prod-media svg{ width:44%; height:44%; stroke: var(--ink); fill:none; stroke-width:1.4; }
  .tag{
    position:absolute; top:14px; left:14px;
    background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg);
    font-size:11px; font-weight:600;
    padding: 5px 10px; border-radius:999px;
  }
  .wish{
    position:absolute; top:12px; right:12px;
    width:32px; height:32px; border-radius:50%;
    background: var(--surface);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  }
  .wish svg{ width:15px; height:15px; stroke: var(--ink); fill:none; stroke-width:1.6; }
  .prod-info{ padding: 18px 20px 20px; }
  .prod-info .cat{ font-size:12px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom:5px; }
  .prod-info h3{ font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:15.5px; margin-bottom:8px; }
  .price-row{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; }
  .price{ font-weight:600; font-size:15px; }
  .price .old{ text-decoration:line-through; color: var(--ink-soft); font-weight:400; font-size:13px; margin-left:6px; }
  .add-btn{
    font-size:12.5px; font-weight:500;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink); border-radius:999px;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    transition: background .15s ease, color .15s ease;
  }
  .add-btn:hover{ background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg); }
  .add-btn.added{ background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); }

  /* ---------- Promo split ---------- */
  .promo-split{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap:24px; }
  .promo-card{
    border-radius:24px;
    padding: 44px 38px;
    min-height: 260px;
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:flex-end;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .promo-card.dark{ background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg); }
  .promo-card.light{ background: var(--icon-bg); color: var(--ink); }
  .promo-card h3{ font-size: clamp(22px,2.4vw,28px); max-width:14ch; margin-bottom:10px; }
  .promo-card p{ font-size:14px; opacity:.8; margin-bottom:20px; max-width: 30ch; }
  .promo-card .btn-text{ border-color: currentColor; }
  .promo-deco{ position:absolute; top:-30px; right:-30px; width:180px; height:180px; opacity:.5; }
  .promo-deco svg{ width:100%; height:100%; }

  /* ---------- Values strip ---------- */
  .values{
    border-top:1px solid var(--line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 44px 0;
  }
  .values .wrap{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap:32px; }
  .value-item{ display:flex; gap:16px; align-items:flex-start; }
  .value-item .vi{
    width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; flex-shrink:0;
    background: var(--icon-bg);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  }
  .value-item svg{ width:19px; height:19px; stroke: var(--ink); fill:none; stroke-width:1.5; }
  .value-item h4{ font-family:'Inter'; font-size:14.5px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:4px; }
  .value-item p{ font-size:13px; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height:1.5; }

  /* ---------- Newsletter ---------- */
  .newsletter{ padding: 70px 0; text-align:center; }
  .newsletter h2{ font-size: clamp(26px,3.4vw,36px); max-width:18ch; margin:0 auto 12px; }
  .newsletter p{ color: var(--ink-soft); max-width:44ch; margin: 0 auto 28px; font-size:14.5px; }
  .nl-form{
    display:flex; max-width:420px; margin:0 auto;
    border:1px solid var(--ink); border-radius:999px; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .nl-form input{
    flex:1; border:none; background:none; padding:14px 20px;
    font-family:'Inter'; font-size:14px; color: var(--ink); outline:none;
  }
  .nl-form input::placeholder{ color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .nl-form button{
    background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg);
    padding: 14px 24px; font-size:14px; font-weight:500; flex-shrink:0;
  }

  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */
  footer{ background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg); padding: 60px 0 26px; }
  .foot-grid{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 32px;
    padding-bottom: 40px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,249,242,0.15);
  }
  .foot-brand .logo{ color: var(--bg); margin-bottom:14px; }
  .foot-brand p{ font-size:13.5px; opacity:.72; max-width:32ch; line-height:1.6; }
  .foot-col h5{ font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:16px; }
  .foot-col ul li{ margin-bottom:10px; }
  .foot-col a{ font-size:13.5px; opacity:.75; transition:opacity .15s ease; }
  .foot-col a:hover{ opacity:1; }
  .foot-bottom{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
    padding-top:22px; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:14px;
  }
  .foot-bottom p{ font-size:12.5px; opacity:.6; }
  .socials{ display:flex; gap:10px; }
  .socials a{
    width:34px; height:34px; border-radius:50%;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,249,242,0.25);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  }
  .socials svg{ width:14px; height:14px; stroke: var(--bg); fill:none; stroke-width:1.5; }

  /* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
  @media (max-width: 980px){
    .hero .wrap{ grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:44px; }
    .hero-visual{ order:-1; max-width:420px; margin:0 auto; }
    .cat-grid{ grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); }
    .prod-grid{ grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
    .promo-split{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .foot-grid{ grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .foot-brand{ grid-column: span 2; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px){
    nav.main-links{ display:none; }
    .burger{ display:flex; width:40px; height:40px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--icon-bg); align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
    .burger span{ display:block; width:16px; height:1.5px; background:var(--ink); position:relative; }
    .burger span::before, .burger span::after{ content:""; position:absolute; width:16px; height:1.5px; background:var(--ink); left:0; }
    .burger span::before{ top:-5px; }
    .burger span::after{ top:5px; }
    .values .wrap{ grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:24px; }
    .cat-grid{ grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px){
    .prod-grid{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .nl-form{ flex-direction:column; border-radius:20px; }
    .nl-form button{ border-radius:0 0 18px 18px; }
    .foot-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .foot-brand{ grid-column: span 1; }
  }

  /* mobile menu overlay */
  .mobile-menu{
    position:fixed; inset:0; background: var(--bg); z-index:100;
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; padding: 24px 28px;
    transform: translateY(-100%); transition: transform .3s ease;
  }
  .mobile-menu.open{ transform: translateY(0); }
  .mobile-menu .mm-top{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:40px; }
  .mobile-menu a{ font-family:'Fraunces', serif; font-size:26px; padding: 14px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .close-btn{ width:40px; height:40px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--icon-bg); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
  .close-btn svg{ width:16px; height:16px; stroke:var(--ink); stroke-width:1.6; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="announce">Gratis ongkir untuk belanja di atas Rp750.000 — pesanan dikirim dalam 2 hari kerja</div>

<header>
  <div class="nav-row">
    <a href="#" class="logo">no<span>o</span>k</a>
    <nav class="main-links">
      <a href="#new">Baru datang</a>
      <a href="#shop">Belanja</a>
      <a href="#rooms">Ruang</a>
      <a href="#best">Terlaris</a>
      <a href="#journal">Jurnal</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="nav-actions">
      <button class="icon-btn" aria-label="Cari">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.5" y2="16.5"/></svg>
      </button>
      <button class="icon-btn" aria-label="Akun">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3.5"/><path d="M5 20c1.3-3.6 4-5.5 7-5.5s5.7 1.9 7 5.5"/></svg>
      </button>
      <button class="icon-btn" aria-label="Keranjang" id="cartBtn">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 8h12l-1 12H7L6 8z"/><path d="M9 8V6a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v2"/></svg>
        <span class="cart-count" id="cartCount">2</span>
      </button>
      <button class="burger" id="burgerBtn" aria-label="Menu"><span></span></button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu">
  <div class="mm-top">
    <a href="#" class="logo" style="padding:0;border:none;">no<span>o</span>k</a>
    <button class="close-btn" id="closeMenu"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="4" y1="4" x2="20" y2="20"/><line x1="20" y1="4" x2="4" y2="20"/></svg></button>
  </div>
  <a href="#new">Baru datang</a>
  <a href="#shop">Belanja</a>
  <a href="#rooms">Ruang</a>
  <a href="#best">Terlaris</a>
  <a href="#journal">Jurnal</a>
</div>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <h1>Ruang yang terasa seperti napas lega.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Furnitur dan perlengkapan sehari-hari untuk rumah yang lebih tenang, hangat, dan terasa lebih "kamu". Dipilih satu per satu, bukan sekadar mengisi rak.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#new" class="btn-primary">Lihat koleksi baru</a>
        <a href="#shop" class="btn-text">Jelajahi semua produk</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-trust">Kurasi tangan pertama, dikirim dalam 2 hari, dengan pengembalian mudah selama 30 hari.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual">
      <div class="hero-illo">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none">
          <path d="M20 170 Q100 150 180 170" stroke="#413333" stroke-width="1.4" opacity="0.35"/>
          <path d="M55 170 V110 Q55 90 78 90 H110 Q130 90 130 110 V170" stroke="#413333" stroke-width="1.6"/>
          <path d="M55 130 H130" stroke="#413333" stroke-width="1.6"/>
          <path d="M48 170 V150 M137 170 V150" stroke="#413333" stroke-width="1.6"/>
          <line x1="150" y1="60" x2="150" y2="170" stroke="#413333" stroke-width="1.6"/>
